<title>NETHERLANDS: Schiphol Airport net profit up 19 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Schiphol Airport net profit up 19 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amsterdam's Schiphol Airport results for 1996 against 1995.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Results	    1996	     1995	pct change</p>
<p>    Net result	 174		146	 +19.4</p>
<p>    Total income     981.8	    883.8     +11.1</p>
<p>    Operational	249		210	 +25.4</p>
<p>result</p>
<p>    Profit per	 1,016.3	  850.9     +19.4</p>
<p>share (guilders)</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
